    <string name="about_us">Med Herb Lens is a non-profit project that utilises Artificial Intelligence
        (Deep Learning - Tensorflow) to assist medicinal herbalists and traditional healers and physicians in automatically
        recognizing and classifying medicinal plants.
        There are 2 ways you may help us out:
        \n\n- Please contribute to the dataset by capturing your own herb images using your own mobile and camera devices,
        then upload them all to our server using this mobile app.
        \n\nThe image quality does not matter, meaning that it is OK to set the lowest image resolutions for your camera. You may take photos in both portrait and horizontal modes, in different environments with different brightness (night vs day, indoor vs outdoor…).
        \n\nWe need details such as fruits, blossoms, branches, leaves, roots, and whole plant, both fresh and sun-dried ones, if possible.
        \n\n- And can you please also help us fill in all the herbs\' details such as usage, side effects, drug interactions etc.? To do this, please browse or search using our search bar to look for the herbs that you are familiar with or have information about. Then you can click on the edit buttons to modify those details at your own convenience.
        You can also find the full list herbal plants that already exist in our database by clicking the Full Herb List button below.
      </string>

